+   * and IPC P08). Combined P3 program: PLAIN (USER), SECRET (PASS, fake Vault leaf), fresh ORDER
+   * reads, and step TWO context [ContextText, LiteralInput], with a real v2 suffix append and a
+   * merged publication; the live ordinary child is scanned at a held sign-in (A68-1..5, AP08-1..3).
+   */
+  @Test
+  void incrementalPlainAndContextCanariesRemainPrivateAcrossMergedPublication() throws Exception {
+    p3Case(
+        () -> {
+          try {
+            p3Mode = P3Mode.LOGIN;
